{"fps": 30, "frames": 1736, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 152, "text": "History's most famous bad day to buy stocks didn't cost you twenty-five years.", "words": [{"w": "History's", "f": 8, "e": 24}, {"w": "most", "f": 24, "e": 32}, {"w": "famous", "f": 33, "e": 44}, {"w": "bad", "f": 45, "e": 51}, {"w": "day", "f": 52, "e": 58}, {"w": "to", "f": 58, "e": 63}, {"w": "buy", "f": 63, "e": 70}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 70, "e": 81}, {"w": "didn't", "f": 82, "e": 93}, {"w": "cost", "f": 94, "e": 102}, {"w": "you", "f": 102, "e": 109}, {"w": "twenty-five", "f": 109, "e": 129}, {"w": "years.", "f": 130, "e": 141}]}, {"a": 152, "b": 334, "text": "September third, nineteen twenty-nine. You're Walter, a Brooklyn tailor, buying at the very top.", "words": [{"w": "September", "f": 154, "e": 172}, {"w": "third,", "f": 172, "e": 184}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 185, "e": 200}, {"w": "twenty-nine.", "f": 201, "e": 223}, {"w": "You're", "f": 224, "e": 236}, {"w": "Walter,", "f": 236, "e": 250}, {"w": "a", "f": 251, "e": 254}, {"w": "Brooklyn", "f": 254, "e": 270}, {"w": "tailor,", "f": 270, "e": 284}, {"w": "buying", "f": 285, "e": 296}, {"w": "at", "f": 297, "e": 302}, {"w": "the", "f": 302, "e": 309}, {"w": "very", "f": 310, "e": 318}, {"w": "top.", "f": 318, "e": 327}]}, {"a": 334, "b": 450, "text": "The Dow closes at three hundred eighty-one. Then October hits.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 336, "e": 342}, {"w": "Dow", "f": 343, "e": 349}, {"w": "closes", "f": 350, "e": 361}, {"w": "at", "f": 362, "e": 366}, {"w": "three", "f": 367, "e": 376}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 377, "e": 390}, {"w": "eighty-one.", "f": 391, "e": 411}, {"w": "Then", "f": 411, "e": 419}, {"w": "October", "f": 420, "e": 433}, {"w": "hits.", "f": 433, "e": 443}]}, {"a": 450, "b": 587, "text": "By July nineteen thirty-two, it's forty-one. Eighty-nine percent, gone.", "words": [{"w": "By", "f": 452, "e": 457}, {"w": "July", "f": 458, "e": 466}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 467, "e": 482}, {"w": "thirty-two,", "f": 482, "e": 503}, {